# Public company website is served from the API host (safariomni.com/) — see deploy/public-web-domains.md
# No separate Static Site or VITE_API_URL needed when using embedded deploy.
#
# Local dev: npm run public-web:dev (port 5180) with Vite proxy, OR:
#   npm run public-web:build && npm run dev  →  http://localhost:3000
